Source landscape: The 2023 documentary universe is broad and cross-perspective, spanning election administration and court records, international and local rights monitoring, press-freedom assessments, digital-rights research, academic work, investigative journalism, and official government statements. Searches covered English and Filipino/Tagalog terms including *halalan*, *kalayaan sa pamamahayag*, *red-tagging*, *karapatang bumoto*, *demokrasya*, and *pagbabago ng konstitusyon*. Search-result leads remain unopened unless marked access_blocked; no evidence claims or scores are recorded.

